{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Steam</strong> is an electrifying fusion of arcade action and mind-bending puzzles, set in a world where time itself is fractured. As a daring adventurer, you must collect the elusive <i>Golden Steams</i> and power up the intricate gears of a mysterious machine. Only by recovering scattered artifacts from different eras\u2014lost and warped by the flow of negative time\u2014can you piece together the ultimate relic to unlock the game\u2019s final, awe-inspiring secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse <strong>10 diverse worlds</strong>, each packed with <strong>10 challenging levels</strong>, where precision and quick thinking are your greatest allies. Master the rotation of enigmatic geometric shapes and manipulate the fragile balance of time to overcome obstacles that defy reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those craving endless thrills, <strong>Golden Steam</strong> offers an intense arcade mode with an ever-growing leaderboard\u2014put your skills to the test in a relentless race against time and entropy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where science fiction meets steampunk, and every second counts in your quest to reclaim what time has stolen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835430?t=1769682816","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835430/70bfab8d9c06d6852242e038e8f22d596b11421b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769682816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835430/0475cd599cd8caadc97d9d6272883916149ca779/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769682816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835430/0475cd599cd8caadc97d9d6272883916149ca779/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769682816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Cont